            "spec_3": "ABV: 46%",
            "nose": "Gentle smoke, aloe, honey, green olive",
            "palate": "Sichuan pepper, grapefruit peel, star fruit, miso, light smoke, citrus lift",
            "body": "Medium bodied, balanced, approachable",
            "finish": "Clean, delicate",
            "desc_body": "This expression captures a classic mezcal profile, balancing smoke, spice, acidity, and subtle sweetness, all grounded by savory mineral notes. Fun to mix but good enough to simply sip neat.",
